<div class="hero-content"><h1 class="birthday-heading" id="birthday-title">Happy Birthday<span class="sr-only">, AFSARA</span></h1><div class="balloon-stage" id="balloon-stage" aria-hidden="true"><div class="name-fallback">AFSARA</div></div><div class="divider" aria-hidden="true">♡</div><p class="hero-subtitle" id="hero-subtitle">The world is a little more beautiful<br>with you in it.</p><a class="btn-love" id="open-surprise" href="#letter">Open your surprise <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="hero-hint" id="hero-hint">A little celebration, made just for you.</p><a class="scroll-note" href="#letter">There’s more love below <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-bottom"></div>
