<section class="section" id="letter" aria-labelledby="letter-title"><div class="container letter-layout"><article class="letter-copy wow animate__fadeInUp"><div class="label">A letter to you</div><h2 id="letter-title"><em>Dear Eve,</em></h2><!-- CUSTOMIZE MESSAGE: edit here or in CONFIG.message below. --><div id="birthday-message"><p>On your special day, I hope you know how deeply loved you are. You bring so much kindness, light, and beauty into the lives of everyone around you.</p><p>You make ordinary moments feel extraordinary. The world feels softer, warmer, and a little more wonderful with you in it.</p><p>May this next chapter bring you quiet happiness, brave new dreams, and a thousand little reasons to smile.</p></div><div class="signature" id="signature">With all my love ♡</div></article><div class="envelope-scene wow animate__fadeInUp" data-wow-delay=".15s" aria-label="A pink envelope with a note saying you are so special"><span class="tiny-star" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><div class="envelope" aria-hidden="true"><div class="note"><div class="little-heart">♡</div><p>You are<br><em>so special.</em></p></div><div class="fold-left"></div><div class="fold-right"></div><div class="fold-bottom"></div><div class="seal">♡</div></div><span class="envelope-caption">Some things are better said from the heart.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section reasons-section" id="little-things" aria-labelledby="reasons-title"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading wow animate__fadeInUp"><div class="label">Four little reasons</div><h2 id="reasons-title">Why you make the world <em>brighter.</em></h2></div><!-- CUSTOMIZE REASONS: edit these four cards. --><div class="reason-grid"><article class="reason wow animate__fadeInUp"><div class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</div><h3>Your kindness</h3><p>The way you care, even in the smallest moments, means more than you know.</p></article><article class="reason wow animate__fadeInUp" data-wow-delay=".08s"><div class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true">✧</div><h3>Your strength</h3><p>Your courage to keep growing and to keep dreaming is a beautiful thing.</p></article><article class="reason wow animate__fadeInUp" data-wow-delay=".16s"><div class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true">❀</div><h3>Your beautiful soul</h3><p>You bring a little warmth, a little joy, and so much heart wherever you go.</p></article><article class="reason wow animate__fadeInUp" data-wow-delay=".24s"><div class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true">☾</div><h3>Just being you</h3><p>Entirely unique. Completely irreplaceable. Wonderful, exactly as you are.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section memories" id="memories" aria-labelledby="memories-title"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading wow animate__fadeInUp"><div class="label">Little moments, big feelings</div><h2 id="memories-title">A few things I’ll always <em>treasure.</em></h2><p>Different days. The same beautiful you.</p></div><div class="polaroids"><figure class="polaroid"><div class="photo-art night" role="img" aria-label="Illustrated placeholder: a moon over lavender hills"><div class="moon"></div><div class="hill back"></div><div class="hill"></div><img id="photo-1" alt="" hidden></div><figcaption id="caption-1">Conversations under the stars<small>JUST YOU &amp; ME</small></figcaption></figure><figure class="polaroid"><div class="photo-art flowers" role="img" aria-label="Illustrated placeholder: pink tulips in afternoon light"><div class="stem"></div><div class="stem"></div><div class="stem"></div><div class="vase"></div><img id="photo-2" alt="" hidden></div><figcaption id="caption-2">The beautiful, ordinary days<small>MY FAVORITE KIND</small></figcaption></figure><figure class="polaroid"><div class="photo-art sunset" role="img" aria-label="Illustrated placeholder: a pastel sunset over the sea"><div class="sun"></div><img id="photo-3" alt="" hidden></div><figcaption id="caption-3">All the adventures still to come<small>HERE’S TO US</small></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="wish-section" id="wish" aria-labelledby="wish-title"><span class="wish-spark a" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><span class="wish-spark b" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><div class="container"><div class="section-heading wow animate__fadeInUp"><div class="label">A little birthday magic</div><h2 id="wish-title">Close your eyes. <em>Make a wish.</em></h2><p>Keep it in your heart, then blow out the candles.</p></div><button class="cake-button" id="cake-button" aria-label="Blow out the birthday candles" aria-describedby="wish-status"><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="cake-photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="" width="1266" height="1600" draggable="false"><span class="candle left"><svg class="candle-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="wax-gold-0" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#855914"/><stop offset=".3" stop-color="#ba8e21"/><stop offset=".53" stop-color="#fff0a0"/><stop offset=".72" stop-color="#d7b744"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#947017"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M12 2 C8 25 24 33 16 55 S3 77 12 96 Q17 107 12 118" fill="none" stroke="#8a6a2855" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 2 C8 25 24 33 16 55 S3 77 12 96 Q17 107 12 118" fill="none" stroke="url(#wax-gold-0)" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span class="wick"></span><span class="flame"></span></span><span class="candle"><svg class="candle-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="wax-gold-1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#855914"/><stop offset=".3" stop-color="#ba8e21"/><stop offset=".53" stop-color="#fff0a0"/><stop offset=".72" stop-color="#d7b744"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#947017"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M12 2 C8 25 24 33 16 55 S3 77 12 96 Q17 107 12 118" fill="none" stroke="#8a6a2855" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 2 C8 25 24 33 16 55 S3 77 12 96 Q17 107 12 118" fill="none" stroke="url(#wax-gold-1)" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span class="wick"></span><span class="flame"></span></span><span class="candle right"><svg class="candle-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="wax-gold-2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#855914"/><stop offset=".3" stop-color="#ba8e21"/><stop offset=".53" stop-color="#fff0a0"/><stop offset=".72" stop-color="#d7b744"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#947017"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M12 2 C8 25 24 33 16 55 S3 77 12 96 Q17 107 12 118" fill="none" stroke="#8a6a2855" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 2 C8 25 24 33 16 55 S3 77 12 96 Q17 107 12 118" fill="none" stroke="url(#wax-gold-2)" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span class="wick"></span><span class="flame"></span></span></span></button><button class="btn-love" id="wish-button">Make a wish <span aria-hidden="true">✧</span></button><p class="wish-status" id="wish-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Tap the cake or the button.<br>This little moment is all yours.</p><button class="text-link" id="relight" hidden>Light the candles again ↻</button></div></section>
